{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t亞太區股市受壓，恒指較早時報23415點，跌353點，跌幅1.49%。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n科技指數跌近3%至4418點。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n另外，內地3大指數跌幅擴大至近0.7%至逾3%。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：宋家樑\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-23T05:43:00.799468+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":83,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none"}}